<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<tmc-service-inc>
<pub id="RM0550J">
<servcat id="09">
<name>SRS Airbag &amp; Seat Belt</name>
<section id="1000Y_S0012" variety="S0012">
<name>SRS Airbag</name>
<ttl id="1000Y_S0012_745Q2_T00B8" variety="T00B8">
<name>SRS Airbag System</name>
<para id="RM000002T0L003X" category="C" type-id="305DA" name-id="554GP-00" from="200612">
<dtccode>B1620</dtccode>
<dtcname>Side airbag sensor assembly RH malfunction</dtcname>
<subpara id="RM000002T0L003X_01" type-id="31" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___000069B00000">
<name>Circuit Description</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<ptxt>The side collision sensor RH (for side airbag and curtain shield airbag deployment judgment) circuit consists of the airbag computer assembly, side airbag sensor assembly RH and airbag sensor rear right. </ptxt>
<ptxt>The side airbag sensor assembly RH detects impacts and sends signals for airbag ignition judgment to the airbag computer assembly. </ptxt>
<ptxt>When a malfunction is detected in the side collision sensor RH (for side airbag and curtain shield airbag deployment judgment) circuit, DTC B1620 is stored in the airbag computer assembly. </ptxt>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="3.00in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="3.08in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC No.</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC Detection Item</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Trouble Area</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B1620</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Airbag sensor rear RH malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Airbag Computer Assembly Malfunction</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
<entry>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>Side Airbag Sensor Assembly RH</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>Airbag Computer Assembly</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002T0L003X_02" type-id="32" category="03" proc-id="RM0550J___000069C00000">
<name>Wiring Diagram</name>
<content5 releasenbr="1">
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C159570J01" width="7.106578999in" height="5.787629434in"/>
</figure>
</content5>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002T0L003X_03" type-id="51" category="05">
<name>Inspection Procedure</name>
</subpara>
<subpara id="RM000002T0L003X_04" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="RM000002T0L003X_04_0001" proc-id="RM0550J___000069D00000">
<scantool type="2"/>
<testtitle>Clear DTC</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the battery negative terminal and wait for 90 seconds.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="C161467J01" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<atten4>
<ptxt>Make sure the ignition switch is OFF before disconnecting the cable from the negative (-) battery terminal.</ptxt>
</atten4>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Interchange the side airbag sensor assembly RH and side airbag sensor assembly LH, connect the connectors and install them securely.</ptxt>
<atten3>
<list1 type="unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>When installing, do not subject the side airbag sensor assembly RH and side airbag sensor assembly LH to strong impacts such as dropping them.</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>If a sensor has been subjected to a strong impact such as being dropped, replace it with a new one.</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</atten3>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Connect the battery negative terminal, turn IG ON and wait for 60 seconds.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), clear the DTCs.</ptxt>
<ptxt>(see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000050J01GX"/>)</ptxt>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002T0L003X_04_0002" fin="false">NEXT</down>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002T0L003X_04_0002" proc-id="RM0550J___000069E00000">
<scantool type="1"/>
<testtitle>Inspect Side Airbag Sensor Assembly RH</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09991-70200</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (TaSCAN), check the DTCs.</ptxt>
<ptxt>(see <xref label="Seep01" href="RM00000050J01GX"/>)</ptxt>
<table>
<title>Result:</title>
<tgroup cols="2">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.89in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.24in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Result</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Proceed to</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC is not output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC B1625 is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>B</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>DTC B1620 is output</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>C</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="RM000002T0L003X_04_0003" fin="true">A</down>
<right ref="RM000002T0L003X_04_0004" fin="true">B</right>
<right ref="RM000002T0L003X_04_0005" fin="true">C</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002T0L003X_04_0003">
<testtitle>Perform Simulation Method<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000ABY03DX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002T0L003X_04_0004">
<testtitle>Side Airbag Sensor Assembly RH<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000000QG100DX"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="RM000002T0L003X_04_0005">
<testtitle>Replace Airbag Computer Assembly<xref label="Seep01" href="RM000002RR0002X"/>
</testtitle>
</testgrp>
</subpara>
</para>
</ttl>
</section>
</servcat>
</pub>
